	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam tibi habeo maximam, quod securum me de datis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad te literis reddideris.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quam verum sit malos esse hosce <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>di<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>es, res ipsa nos docet; sed imponet dominus his quoque omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>finem, ut merito gratulamur clarissimis illis et optimis viris, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quos dominus hinc antequam prorsus mala ingravescant, eripit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Incertum est, quur ad suos reditum maturet <persName>Philippus</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>urget illum fortassis iudicium domini.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> quidam constanter <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>affirmant missurum ad concilium, si papa concilii authoritati <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>subiicere se velit, deinde si de nullo prophano negocio <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quicquam illic statuendum sit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego nullo fructu, sed magno <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ludibrio missum iri video <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> pauculos doctos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Nos domini Zebaoth aures sanctissimis assiduisque precibus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>pulsemus, ut sic omnia moderetur, quo impiorum impiissimi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>conatus, ut plane digni sunt, frustrentur, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nos vero sibi fidentes nunquam pudefiamus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Man schribt mir gar nichts newes von <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dann das ettlich mainen wellen, der kaiser kome nitt <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>mehr von <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName>, das ouch das concilium aller <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ding solle verlengeret werden, byß man seche, ob kai[<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>serliche] m[ajesta]t alls der recht executor wol widerum uff sein <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>welle; dann sollt durante concilio ain interregnum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>infallen und der kaiser die ougen zuͦthain, hettend <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sich die gaistlichen grosser ding zuͦ befaren, und sorgt man <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sich grosser unruͦ, zuͦdem das der <placeName ref="l2510">Turck</placeName> sein sach <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>macht.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Der allmechtig, truw gott kom unns <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>gnedigklich zuͦ hilff, amen.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Commenda nos domino et vale.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>12. aprilis 1551.</s>
